{"data":{"body":"[P2] Add a local execution test for this scenario. Unlike cases 21, 23, and 24, case 22 only receives AST/template wiring checks; package CI never runs its wait/replay or concurrent parallel/map callbacks. Context-parent regressions or incorrect probe counts can therefore pass local CI, while fork PRs skip the credentialed conformance job. Add a `DurableFunctionTestRunner` test for both plugin views that verifies probe counts and parents across resume and confirms ambient-context restoration.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM74nnMU","finding_digest":"0879d53172687aaeba10498d21d1fcf6d5cf06a2dcf42d9f80f2a1322cbb6f9b","finding_id":"arf_v1_bb45kmlsnb5k5oqqjggsdup463","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests-otel/src/otel_22_user_function_context.py::handler::local-behavior-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests-otel/src/otel_22_user_function_context.py::handler::local-behavior-coverage","line":91,"observation_digest":"705c0103263ebae5aedc3427af0c991b563eeb7492729c535b2fbaf14f34fc7f","observation_id":"aro_v1_oboacazgh25ollw4gqt26dezdn","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests-otel/src/otel_22_user_function_context.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T01:33:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lqdbpnxakorwvdflkozkilcpeu","reviewed_base_sha":"0ea7ea2598e399bc90587b60910c5a63002b8111","reviewed_head_sha":"049099ef35abfd2834b146b03a605a99eef32d0f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":90,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":758},"record_id":"art_v1_lwjismw3ck4jggysojvk625rzh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T01:33:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
